# Out-of-repo scratch area: a telephony/LiveKit spike with its own Node toolchain,
# lockfile, and dependencies. It is not part of the JARVIS control plane, its
# contents are third-party `node_modules` trees, and it carries its own nested
# `.gitignore` and `.env`. The durable findings were promoted into
# `docs/research/integrations/`, so the directory is disposable and absent from a
# clean checkout; this rule stays so the area cannot be published accidentally if
# it is recreated. Excluding it prevents untracked files from being added; it does
# not make the directory invisible to repository tooling, which is handled
# separately by the docs validator.
docs/research-telephony/